 well established.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-planting-window", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-planting-window", "APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-depth", "APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-moisture", "RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages agree"}]}}, {"draft_mode": "llm:mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct", "ok": true, "problems": [], "figures_checked": 21, "sentences_checked": 9, "judge": {"model": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "verdicts": [{"n": 1, "sentence": "For soybean planting in the northern region, choose a planting window.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-planting-window", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-planting-window"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages mention window"}, {"n": 2, "sentence": "Do not plant too early before the rains are well established to avoid prolonged dry spells that may cause the plants to die [IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-moisture].", "cited": ["IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-moisture"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passage matches sentence"}, {"n": 3, "sentence": "Choose a planting depth.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-depth"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages give depth"}, {"n": 4, "sentence": "Choose a plant spacing.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages give spacing"}, {"n": 5, "sentence": "The rainfall record for Tamale district from 2026-09-25 to 2026-10-24 shows 15 of 30 days with at least 1 mm of rain, totaling 137.2 mm [RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25].", "cited": ["RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passage matches data"}, {"n": 6, "sentence": "The guides give no rainfall amount that marks onset, so the officer decides.", "cited": ["APNI-SARI-2023:p11-planting-window", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-planting-window", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-moisture", "APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-depth", "APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing", "IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing", "RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25"], "verdict": "supported", "why": "Passages imply decision"}]}}]}, "draft": "**Advice for the Extension Officer:**\n\nFor soybean planting in the northern region, choose a planting window. One source says mid-June to late July [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-planting-window], another says mid-June to mid-July [IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-planting-window].\n\nDo not plant too early before the rains are well established to avoid prolonged dry spells that may cause the plants to die [IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-moisture].\n\nChoose a planting depth. One source says 5 cm [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-depth], another says 3 cm and not deeper than 5 cm [IITA-SSPING-2022:p18-depth].\n\nChoose a plant spacing. One source says 50 cm between rows and 15 cm between plants [APNI-SARI-2023:p11-spacing], another says 50 cm between rows and 10 cm between plants [IITA-SSPING-2022:p17-spacing].\n\nThe rainfall record for Tamale district from 2026-09-25 to 2026-10-24 shows 15 of 30 days with at least 1 mm of rain, totaling 137.2 mm [RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25]. The guides give no rainfall amount that marks onset, so the officer decides.\n\nNote: (officer only) Question received 25 Oct 2026. Windows cited: CSIR-SARI/APNI, northern region: between mid-June and late July; IITA, northern region: between mid-June to mid-July. The date is outside the cited windows.\nNote: (officer only) District Tamale taken from the question text.\nNote: (officer only) Rainfall record [RAINFALL-OPEN-METEO:tamale:2026-10-25] for Tamale, 2026-09-25 to 2026-10-24: 15 rain days (at least 1 mm), 137.2 mm in total, 0 days missing (Open-Meteo (model-based estimate, forecast API past days)). This is a model estimate for one point in the district, not a rain gauge reading; estimates can differ a lot from a local gauge and from other providers. The guides give no rainfall amount that marks onset; AgriReach does not say whether onset has been reached. The officer decides.", "drafted_by": "model", "usage": {"attempted": 4, "calls": 4, "failed": 0, "errors": [], "by_role": {"draft": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 3191, "completion_tokens": 757}, "judge": {"calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 4555, "completion_tokens": 319}}, "cost_usd": 0.000948}}
